WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:15.300 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Clear the mid wave, then group up with your team. We're up 11 to 4: take objectives first, then push towers.

2
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: I just solo-killed Qiyana. Can I push the tower now?

3
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:26.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Go ahead. You're at about 1,600 health, healthy. Take the mid tower with this wave, then back off so you don't get chunked.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.200 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: So what do I buy when I go back?

5
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:35.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Get Mercury's Treads. You're at full health at eleven minutes,

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: but champions like Qiyana will chase you down, and Mercs keep you alive.

7
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:45.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Start with Berserker's Greaves and a Recurve Bow: Yone's Q scales with attack speed. Don't rush Infinity Edge; finish it when you have the gold.

8
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Should I go mid and force a teamfight now?

9
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:57.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Go for it. It's eleven minutes, we're well ahead on kills, and your health is enough. Start the fight together with your team.

10
00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Can we take Baron after this fight?

11
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.400 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Not yet. Baron doesn't spawn until 20 minutes.

12
00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:09.200 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: We're ahead on gold, so take dragon and the outer towers first, and fight for Baron when it's up.

13
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Can I just take the top tower?

14
00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:19.800 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Not yet, you only have 320 health. Back off behind the tower, recall to resupply, and push with an escort.

15
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:28.200 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: I've recalled. Where do I go first?

16
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:34.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Bottom lane first. Help your team control the wave there, then split-push later.

17
00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: How did Qiyana one-shot me?

18
00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:49.400 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Don't worry. Once you respawn, keep pushing your lane. We're up 14 to 6, a big lead.

19
00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:55.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Watch how the jungle fight goes. We lead 14 to 6; if we win it, push the tower.

20
00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:15.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: So when I respawn, do I go split-push right away?

21
00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:19.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Help control the bottom wave first, then split-push.

22
00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:32.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Nice! That kill was huge. It really opened up the game.

23
00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Can I grab dragon now while we're ahead?

24
00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:41.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Yes. Clear the mid wave, then rotate with the team. Don't walk the jungle alone.

25
00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.800 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Their Orianna is mid. Can I fight her?

26
00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:58.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Yes. You're level 11 with your ult up. Go in and poke, but don't get caught by Orianna's ult.

27
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:08.400 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Nice! That assist was key. Keep farming your lane until the team groups up.

28
00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.800 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: I have my ult this time. Can I just engage?

29
00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:16.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Hold off. Your health is too low and you'd get one-shot. Wait for the team.
